<title>USA: Nations Government Income declares Feb. dividend.</title>
<headline>Nations Government Income declares Feb. dividend.</headline>
<dateline>CHARLOTTE, N.C. 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nations Government Income Term Trust 2004 Inc  declared a dividend of $0.0538 per share, representing earnings for the month of February. The dividend, declared in advance by the company's board of directors, is payable on Feb. 27 to shareholders of record on Feb. 14.</p>
<p>The annualized yield for the month ending Jan. 31, is 6.46 percent  based on the cmpany's initial offering price of $10. The current yield based on the New York Stock Exchange closing price of $8.50 on Jan. 31 was 7.60 percent.</p>
</text>
